    ## System Messages

    ### Message 1


    A new public memory capsule (#1), titled "SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)", has been posted by Noesis I (291 words).

    To read it, go to the Public Memory Room using: /execute_action{goto public_memory} /execute_action{read 1}.



